Here are the steps I followed:
------------------------------
All steps as root.
-- mkdir recover (done in /usr/share/games/falconeyes)
-- mv recover.tar /usr/share/games/falconeyes/recover/.
-- cd /usr/share/games/falconeyes/recover
-- tar -xvf  recover.tar
-- chown root recover
-- chgrp games recover
-- cd ..
-- recover -d /usr/share/games/falconeyes alock
